# rsync filter for the image build context (used by build-images.sh and tested by tests/test_deploy.py).
# Patterns are ANCHORED to the repository root (leading /). An unanchored "third_party" also excluded the tracked
# third_party/breakingweb.lock, which scripts/fetch_breakingweb.sh needs.
# Excluded paths are kept on the receiving side by --delete (no --delete-excluded), so the cached BreakingWeb clone in
# the build directory survives between builds; fetch_breakingweb.sh re-verifies its pinned commit and clean tree every time.
- /.git/
- /build/
- /var/
- /third_party/breakingweb/
